  "title": "Yukon Gold Mashed Potatoes with Roasted Shallots",
  "description": "Boiled Yukon Gold potatoes are whipped with evaporated skim milk and oven roasted shallots in this recipe from the American Diabetes Association.",
  "authors": [
    "Robyn Webb"
  ],
